    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Avoiding the Ghost\n\n\r\nWatch out for the Ghost, who will be trying
        to catch you as you explore the mansion!\n\r\nThe Ghost is invisible, but
        you can see them through your Night Vision.\n\r\nYou can also sense when
        the Ghost is close, if you pay close attention.\n\r\nThe Ghost can see both
        the light from your Lantern and footprints you leave behind while moving.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
