    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Tips



        Vents are powerful tools for avoiding the Ghost, letting
        you reach faraway spots much quicker.



        Each vent you travel to
        will become permanently unusable afterwards, so make sure to only rely on
        them in a pinch!



        If you are struggling to find the right items,
        an arrow will eventually appear to point you in the direction of one you
        have yet to collect.



        Keep an eye on the time limit, because when
        it runs out, the Ghost will get angry for real, and things will probably
        not end well for you.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
