    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Catching the Robber\n\n\r\nYou can follow clues left behind by the
        Robber to find them.\n\r\nYour Step Vision lets you see their footprints,
        and their location will be revealed to you when they use their Lantern.\n\r\nThe
        Robber cannot see you unless you Dash or they use their Night Vision, but
        they can feel when you get close.\n\r\nVents, which are scattered around
        the mansion, lets them quickly get away from you but they can only travel
        to each vent once. Use that to your advantage!\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
