      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<color=#ebaaa7>Hi! Thanks for playtesting our game! </color> \n\n<color=#780f7c>Haunted
        Heist</color> is a two-player competitive game. One player controls the <color=yellow>Robber</color>,
        who is trying to steal loot from the mansion and then escape, while the other
        plays as the <color=yellow>Ghost</color>, trying to stop the Robber.\n\nTo
        begin with, all you need to do is to go ahead and <color=yellow>play</color>
        a couple of games with your opponent, and make sure that the tutorials are
        turned on! Don't worry, you will have a chance to try out both of the roles.\n\nGood
        luck!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
