    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Tips\n\n\r\nThe Robber will likely outrun you if you just chase after
        them. Use clever tactics catch them off-guard instead!\n\r\nYour Dash lets
        you move through walls and other solid objects, allowing you to take big
        shortcuts through the mansion.\n\r\nIf you can slow down the Robber\u2019s
        progress long enough for the time limit to expire, you will gain a major
        advantage, so do not lose hope even if you are unable to catch them!\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
