    - target: {fileID: 1320460311782135910, guid: ddf1d33731ea2c941ab3af76b5060fb3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<color=#ebaaa7>Hi! Thanks for playtesting our game! </color> \n\n<color=#780f7c>Haunted
        Heist</color> is a two-player competitive game.  One player controls the
        <color=yellow>Robber</color>, trying to steal loot from the mansion and then
        escape, while the other plays as the <color=yellow>Ghost</color>, who wants
        to stop the Robber.\n\nFirst, we ask you to try out both roles in the <color=yellow>Tutorial.</color>\n\nAfter
        you have done that, go ahead and <color=yellow>play</color> a couple of games
        with your opponent.\n\nGood luck!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
